{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"This material supports user declared materials.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/Material"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships"},{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaAssets\/documentation\/AdaAssets\/Asset","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/SQ","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/SH","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/init(from:)","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/init(wrappedValue:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/material","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/projectedValue","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/wrappedValue"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/collectDefines(for:keys:)","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/configureRenderPipeline(for:keys:shaderModule:)","doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/update()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Subscripts","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/CustomMaterial\/subscript(dynamicMember:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Subscripts"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adarender\/custommaterial"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@propertyWrapper"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@dynamicMemberLookup"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CustomMaterial"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ReflectedMaterial","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaRender\/documentation\/AdaRender\/ReflectedMaterial","preciseIdentifier":"s:9AdaRender17ReflectedMaterialP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It’s very powerful tool for creating your own materials using power of Swift."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can declare any materials and describe what kind of values can be used in your shader."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Like example, we can define our custom canvas material."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct MyCanvasMaterial: CanvasMaterial {","","    \/\/ Bind color with u_Color uniform value in shader","    @Uniform(binding: 0, propertyName: \"u_Color\")","    var color: Color = .blue","","    \/\/ Path to glsl shader source","    static func fragment() throws -> ShaderSource {","        try ResourceLoader.loadSync(\"PATH_TO_FRAGMENT_SHADER.glsl\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After that, we should write our own fragment shader code:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"c++","code":["#version 330 core","#pragma stage : frag \/\/ Declare that this code can be used for fragment shading","","#include <AdaEngine\/CanvasMaterial.frag> \/\/ Include basic canvas header code for you shader","","\/\/ Declare you material uniform","layout (std140, binding = 2) uniform CustomMaterial {","    vec4 u_Color; \/\/ This property will be changed from MyCanvasMaterial","};","","[[main]]","void my_material_fragment()","{","    COLOR = u_Color; \/\/ Set material color to output color value.","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"And than, you can pass our new material to anywhere you want. Also CustomMaterial supports @propertyWrapper magic"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let mesh = Mesh()","let customMaterial = CustomMaterial(MyCanvasMaterial())","let meshComponent = Mesh2D(mesh: mesh, materials: [customMaterial])","","entity.components += meshComponent","","\/\/ -- or --","let mesh = Mesh()","@CustomMaterial var customMaterial = MyCanvasMaterial()","","\/\/ Send custom material using $ symbol. We should pass CustomMaterial<MyCanvasMaterial> instance","let meshComponent = Mesh2D(mesh: mesh, materials: [$customMaterial])","","entity.components += meshComponent"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can update material values with two different ways with reflection or string literals."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let customMaterial = CustomMaterial(MyCanvasMaterial())","","\/\/ Pass new value into material using reflection.","customMaterial.color = .blue","","\/\/ Pass new value into material using string literals","\/\/ In this case we should think about correct name of uniform member.","customMaterial.setValue(Color.blue, for: \"u_Color\")"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","title":"CustomMaterial","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CustomMaterial"}],"modules":[{"name":"AdaRender"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text